         Deliberately a bare noun phrase with NO placeholder: the amount above it
         is formatted by Play (currency symbol, position and grouping all vary),
         and splitting a price into symbol + digits breaks in fa, where the unit
         is a word. -->
    <string name="plan_hero_unit">per month</string>
