    <!-- Same perk, for a brand whose allowance does NOT come back. Chosen when
         the cashier reports period_days = 0. No GB figure: the allowance is
         server-driven per brand and per region, so a number written here goes
         stale silently and is simply wrong for some users. -->
    <string name="paywall_perk_data_body_once">Your free data is a one-time allowance. Premium never runs out.</string>
